Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.36,0:00:09.09,Main,GEORG,0,0,0,,Welcome to the demonic \Nrealm, and my territory!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.09,0:00:14.35,Main,GEORG,0,0,0,,Now, let us battle at our full power!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.54,0:01:50.00,Ep_Title,TITLE,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}Decisive Battle
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.43,0:01:53.87,Main,FIO,0,0,0,,Now go, and don't look back.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.18,0:01:56.93,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,Fio...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.10,0:02:09.46,Italics,CELINA,0,0,0,,I'm so scared that I don't know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.82,0:02:15.34,Italics,CELINA,0,0,0,,I don't want to hurt anyone, \Nbut I don't want to be hurt either.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.82,0:02:19.50,Italics,CELINA,0,0,0,,I wish I could just run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.01,0:02:29.51,Italics,CELINA,0,0,0,,I need to go after Fio.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.07,0:02:40.34,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,Huh... Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.01,0:02:42.17,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.80,0:02:50.63,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,I guess I really don't want to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.54,0:02:53.07,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,I'm such a coward!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.06,0:02:56.90,Main,FIO,0,0,0,,Plant Bind!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.76,0:03:02.62,Main,GIO,0,0,0,,He's wide open!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.49,0:03:04.74,Main,ELF1,0,0,0,,Energy Bolt!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.66,0:03:08.37,Main,GIO,0,0,0,,How's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.13,0:03:15.50,Main,GELLEN,0,0,0,,Not bad. That was some decent teamwork.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.69,0:03:18.64,Main,FIO,0,0,0,,What? It didn't hurt him at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.64,0:03:20.26,Main,GELLEN,0,0,0,,But it's not enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.15,0:03:25.68,Main,FIO,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.22,0:03:30.28,Main,GELLEN,0,0,0,,I can transform myself at will.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.62,0:03:36.02,Main,GELLEN,0,0,0,,My armor and my axe are \Npart of my body as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.68,0:03:41.52,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,Everyone—Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.09,0:03:48.04,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,But my body... finally moved.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.86,0:03:53.03,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,Dolan...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.03,0:03:55.05,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,Please give me strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.05,0:03:58.66,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,I don't want to hurt anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.66,0:03:59.91,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.35,0:04:05.15,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,I want to see people getting hurt even less!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.03,0:04:14.01,Main,GELLEN,0,0,0,,Are you done, my elven warriors?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.67,0:04:17.64,Main,FIO,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.40,0:04:27.71,Main,GELLEN,0,0,0,,Rest in piece, elven warrior!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.06,0:04:29.36,Main,FIO,0,0,0,,Don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.87,0:04:32.31,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,Earth Chain Bind!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.97,0:04:41.10,Main,FIO,0,0,0,,Celina? Why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.19,0:04:46.44,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,I can still fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.55,0:04:51.59,Main,GELLEN,0,0,0,,So you're back, lamia.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.59,0:04:54.31,Main,GELLEN,0,0,0,,That's the spirit!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.51,0:04:57.64,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,Jalaam!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.08,0:05:02.94,Main,FIO,0,0,0,,Wow, Celina.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.94,0:05:06.45,Main,GELLEN,0,0,0,,Very nice. \NHow about this, girlie?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.45,0:05:08.45,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,Titan Fist!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.17,0:05:16.37,Main,FIO,0,0,0,,Celina...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.37,0:05:19.37,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,Stand back, Fio.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.77,0:05:25.59,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,My mana output is scary \Neven for me right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.68,0:05:29.00,Main,FIO,0,0,0,,O-Okay, got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.50,0:05:35.73,Main,GELLEN,0,0,0,,That's it, lamia. This is great.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.09,0:05:39.04,Main,GELLEN,0,0,0,,I'll respond in kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.35,0:05:42.62,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,I've made up my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.04,0:05:44.98,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,Gaia Strike!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.96,0:05:52.73,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,O snake blood that flows within me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.10,0:05:54.90,Main,GELLEN,0,0,0,,I'll stop you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.10,0:05:56.34,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,O snake curse that binds my very soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.25,0:06:02.98,Main,GELLEN,0,0,0,,How could this be?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.98,0:06:05.46,Main,GELLEN,0,0,0,,A lamia's cursed eyes froze me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.46,0:06:08.34,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,I beseech you and your wretched nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.34,0:06:10.71,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,Raise a cursed battle cry
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.71,0:06:14.07,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,and douse all life with your venom!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.07,0:06:16.85,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,Eun Jalaam!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.26,0:06:24.48,Main,GELLEN,0,0,0,,I am not going down!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.76,0:06:28.43,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,And I cannot afford to lose!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.49,0:06:37.74,Main,GELLEN,0,0,0,,What? It's almost like a dragon...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.32,0:06:49.07,Main,FIO,0,0,0,,She won.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.07,0:06:51.12,Main,GIO,0,0,0,,She actually beat a demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.59,0:06:56.40,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,I did it, Dolan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.31,0:07:01.76,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,What a sad place.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.08,0:07:06.04,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,You called this your territory, \Nbut I don't even see a castle here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.52,0:07:12.78,Main,GEORG,0,0,0,,I lead a mercenary's life. I am \Nmerely a hired hand of the royals.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.09,0:07:15.42,Main,GEORG,0,0,0,,Please excuse the lack of pomp.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.42,0:07:16.75,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,It doesn't bother me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.36,0:07:21.93,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Here, I can swing my blade \Nto my heart's content.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.98,0:07:26.35,Main,GEORG,0,0,0,,Oh, the heart of a progenitor dragon,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.35,0:07:28.76,Main,GEORG,0,0,0,,one of the seven original dragons...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.22,0:07:33.42,Main,GEORG,0,0,0,,You are the dragon who was more feared \Nthan the wretched gods themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.06,0:07:39.35,Main,GEORG,0,0,0,,Now, see if you can handle me at my best!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.77,0:07:43.32,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,I'll grant your desire.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.79,0:07:49.07,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,But it'll cost you your entire existence.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.34,0:07:55.20,Main,GEORG,0,0,0,,My blades shall cut you down to size!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.01,0:08:08.08,Main,GEORG,0,0,0,,Cry, heavens... Heavenly Death Throes!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.97,0:08:13.99,Main,GEORG,0,0,0,,Roar, earth... Earthly Death Tremors!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.96,0:08:21.29,Main,GEORG,0,0,0,,Heaven and Earth Rending!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.96,0:08:25.62,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,I'll slice it all apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.32,0:08:34.45,Main,GEORG,0,0,0,,This is the reward for all my waiting!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.65,0:08:42.83,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,Chris!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.29,0:08:48.01,Main,DIADORA,0,0,0,,Oh, it's you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.58,0:08:55.60,Main,FIO,0,0,0,,Diadora? Weren't you part of the Gio squad?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.60,0:08:57.37,Main,DIADORA,0,0,0,,My apologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.37,0:09:01.46,Main,DIADORA,0,0,0,,I had a score to settle \Nwith one of the demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.46,0:09:02.94,Main,GIO,0,0,0,,Oh, for crying out loud...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.29,0:09:05.24,Main,GIO,0,0,0,,Anyway, where's Dolan?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.52,0:09:08.10,Main,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,He went ahead to the portal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.47,0:09:10.49,Main,DIADORA,0,0,0,,We should hurry, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.48,0:09:23.41,Main,OLIVIA,0,0,0,,I see. So they went to the\N demonic realm to battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.43,0:09:32.03,Main,OLIVIA,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.03,0:09:33.70,Main,DIO,0,0,0,,Lady Olivia.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.70,0:09:36.70,Main,DIO,0,0,0,,The demon soldiers in the \Narea have been dealt with.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.68,0:09:40.96,Main,VLAIC,0,0,0,,Where did that powerful demon \Nguarding the portal go?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.53,0:09:45.48,Main,OLIVIA,0,0,0,,It seems he and Dolan went \Nto the demonic realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.48,0:09:48.37,Main,ALSIENNE,0,0,0,,What? He returned to the demonic realm?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.72,0:09:53.99,Main,ALSIENNE,0,0,0,,Is this not a golden opportunity for us?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.36,0:10:01.46,Main,DIO,0,0,0,,True. If we close the portal now,\N the forest will be saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.99,0:10:03.48,Main,DIO,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.81,0:10:07.61,Main,VLAIC,0,0,0,,Come on, now. Dolan is \Nstill there fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.61,0:10:10.95,Main,ALSIENNE,0,0,0,,Yes, I'm aware that it isn't \Nthe right thing to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.36,0:10:16.22,Main,ALSIENNE,0,0,0,,But righteousness isn't worth risking \Nthe lives of everyone here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.22,0:10:17.64,Main,VLAIC,0,0,0,,Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.42,0:10:53.43,Main,GEORG,0,0,0,,I'm not done yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.68,0:11:00.17,Main,GEORG,0,0,0,,Behold the sword techniques \NI spent all my years perfecting.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.23,0:11:04.84,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,Huh? You're destroying the portal?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.22,0:11:08.72,Main,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,Do you realize that Dolan is\N fighting on the other side?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.72,0:11:14.01,Main,ALSIENNE,0,0,0,,The top priority of this operation \Nis to restore peace to the forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.01,0:11:16.45,Main,ALSIENNE,0,0,0,,We won't have a better chance to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.45,0:11:19.77,Main,GIO,0,0,0,,I don't agree with leaving him to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.77,0:11:21.69,Main,FIO,0,0,0,,Are you serious, Father?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.35,0:11:24.95,Main,DIO,0,0,0,,We have no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.95,0:11:30.00,Main,DIO,0,0,0,,Powerful reinforcements may be \Non their way here as we speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.28,0:11:33.01,Main,VLAIC,0,0,0,,And if Dolan were to lose...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.10,0:11:37.65,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,He won't!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.00,0:11:41.50,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,D-Dolan would never lose!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.73,0:11:44.34,Main,ALSIENNE,0,0,0,,I understand wanting to \Nput your faith in him,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.34,0:11:46.02,Main,ALSIENNE,0,0,0,,but what guarantee do we have?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.02,0:11:48.27,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,W-Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.27,0:11:50.93,Main,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,I agree that Dolan won't lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.93,0:11:52.16,Main,VLAIC,0,0,0,,And why's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.16,0:11:53.12,Main,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,Just a hunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.90,0:11:55.18,Main,ALSIENNE,0,0,0,,A hunch?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.18,0:12:00.14,Main,DIO,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but that's not very convincing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.14,0:12:05.36,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,He's putting his life on \Nthe line to fight for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.78,0:12:07.67,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,If he were scared for his life,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.67,0:12:11.60,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,he could've waited for the \Nkingdom's forces to arrive.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.87,0:12:17.24,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,But he's fighting to protect the\N inhabitants of the Forest of Ente!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.09,0:12:22.42,Main,DIADORA,0,0,0,,Celina's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.42,0:12:29.13,Main,DIADORA,0,0,0,,If we close the portal now, \Nwe'll disgrace ourselves for all eternity.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.13,0:12:34.18,Main,GIO,0,0,0,,And that's no different to \Nbeing wiped out by the demons!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.18,0:12:35.63,Main,FIO,0,0,0,,Yep, yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.63,0:12:37.24,Main,DIO,0,0,0,,You kids...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.36,0:12:39.45,Main,VLAIC,0,0,0,,Sigh.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.99,0:12:42.53,Main,VLAIC,0,0,0,,What was I so afraid of?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.53,0:12:47.29,Main,ALSIENNE,0,0,0,,I suppose victory is not the \Nbe all and end all in this battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.77,0:12:52.58,Main,DIO,0,0,0,,Very well. We'll stake our \Nfuture on Dolan's victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.26,0:12:56.80,Italics,CELINA,0,0,0,,Dolan...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.37,0:13:04.33,Main,GEORG,0,0,0,,Can you see through the flash of my blades?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.33,0:13:06.93,Main,GEORG,0,0,0,,Death by Four Thousand Slashes!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.16,0:13:33.16,Main,KALAVITH,0,0,0,,Oho?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.26,0:13:52.89,Main,GEORG,0,0,0,,I'll have your head!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.89,0:13:56.26,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,I'm not about to let you have it so easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.80,0:14:15.59,Main,GEORG,0,0,0,,I'm not done!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.59,0:14:16.99,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.63,0:14:26.69,Main,GEORG,0,0,0,,My best wasn't good enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.62,0:14:32.22,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,But your aura and fighting spirit \Nwere as good as Ardes's.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.82,0:14:38.40,Main,GEORG,0,0,0,,I am... truly... honored...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.91,0:14:46.09,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Consider my blade to represent the \Nforest folk whose lives you took and perish.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.14,0:14:49.26,Main,GEORG,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.81,0:14:56.37,Main,GEORG,0,0,0,,But I... regret... nothing...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.89,0:15:04.26,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Rest well, irredeemable fallen war god.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.62,0:15:08.87,Main,KALAVITH,0,0,0,,Found you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.33,0:15:12.25,Main,KALAVITH,0,0,0,,There you are, at last!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.73,0:15:15.51,Main,KALAVITH,0,0,0,,I knew you weren't gone forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.01,0:15:25.22,Main,KALAVITH,0,0,0,,Nothing could make me happier than \Ngetting to play with you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.25,0:15:29.33,Main,KALAVITH,0,0,0,,Wait for me, Dolly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.63,0:15:44.86,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,Dolan!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.86,0:15:47.12,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Celina. You're okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.79,0:15:52.81,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,Right back at you, Dolan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.30,0:16:06.36,Main,GIO,0,0,0,,Victory is ours!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.36,0:16:08.46,Main,ALL,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.23,0:16:30.81,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,I didn't expect you to \Nthrow such a big party.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.81,0:16:35.50,Main,GIO,0,0,0,,We may be rebuilding, but we can't \Nbid our friends a quiet farewell.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.75,0:16:39.47,Main,DIADORA,0,0,0,,It's too bad, but I suppose \Nthere's no avoiding it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.47,0:16:40.95,Main,FIO,0,0,0,,Tada!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.39,0:16:45.34,Main,FIO,0,0,0,,Don't they both look amazing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.34,0:16:48.26,Main,FIO,0,0,0,,Traditional elven dancer attire!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.53,0:16:53.93,Main,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,P-Please stop staring.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.93,0:16:57.15,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,Um... Wh-What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.15,0:17:03.40,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Getting to see you two beauties in such \Ncharming attire is a huge reward in itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.83,0:17:06.54,Main,FIO,0,0,0,,You don't mince words, Dolan.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.54,0:17:10.23,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Huh? I only stated what I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.26,0:17:12.82,Main,FELF1,0,0,0,,Miss Christina.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.82,0:17:14.98,Main,FELF2,0,0,0,,May we talk to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.98,0:17:16.64,Main,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,Uh, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.32,0:17:23.15,Main,FIO,0,0,0,,Dolan, you know what to do next, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.78,0:17:36.79,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Celina, may I have this dance?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.35,0:17:40.02,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.37,0:17:48.21,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,How are your wounds, Celina?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.21,0:17:49.73,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,All healed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.29,0:17:52.35,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,That's good to hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.13,0:18:00.30,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,You know, I tried to run \Naway from the battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.01,0:18:06.29,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,I ran my mouth, but I couldn't do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.22,0:18:10.84,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,But you stayed and fought, did you not?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.84,0:18:14.34,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,That's what makes you strong. \NHold your head high.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.22,0:18:17.15,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,It was all thanks to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.43,0:18:20.98,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,When I thought I couldn't go on,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.98,0:18:23.74,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,I held that magic crystal you gave me tight,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.74,0:18:27.55,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,and it felt like you were \Nthere and you had my back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.45,0:18:31.61,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,I'm happy I could be of help to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.94,0:18:35.95,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,You say these things so casually.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.63,0:18:38.95,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,You really don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.01,0:18:47.26,Italics,CELINA,0,0,0,,Neither do I, honestly.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.01,0:18:59.82,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,Have some more, Dolan...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.87,0:19:12.04,Italics,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,That boy was kinder
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.04,0:19:20.55,Italics,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,And stronger than anyone
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.55,0:19:27.95,Italics,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,As the days passed by
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.95,0:19:36.44,Italics,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,He became a young man and a hero
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.44,0:19:45.83,Italics,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,Together with the white dragon
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.83,0:19:52.82,Italics,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,He defeated the dragon of evil
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.82,0:20:01.22,Italics,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,The world hailed the spirits of the two
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.22,0:20:11.06,Italics,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,It was saved by the bond \Nbetween the hero and dragon
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.86,0:20:18.36,Main,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,You were listening, Dolan?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.36,0:20:21.77,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,I'm guessing that was a song about the hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.57,0:20:27.65,Main,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,Yes, that's right. Sorry you \Nhad to hear my awful singing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.65,0:20:30.40,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Please, that was beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.78,0:20:33.41,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Where did you learn that song?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.68,0:20:37.43,Main,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,It's been passed down by \Nfamily for generations.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.00,0:20:39.31,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Your family?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.10,0:20:42.23,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.52,0:20:46.59,Main,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,Did you not like it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.59,0:20:48.90,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,No, I loved it, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.90,0:20:53.73,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,But I was wondering what happened after \Nthey defeated the dragon of evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.97,0:20:57.60,Main,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,Oh, what happens next?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.60,0:21:00.26,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,If there is more, I'd love to hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.85,0:21:04.13,Main,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. That's all there is to the song.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.74,0:21:09.00,Main,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,The hero and his party, along with the \Nwhite dragon, defeat the dragon of evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.40,0:21:11.16,Main,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,The end.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.41,0:21:16.41,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,I see. That's too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.35,0:21:18.88,Main,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,Say, Dolan.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.88,0:21:23.31,Main,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,What do you think happened to the hero \Nand the white dragon in the end?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.31,0:21:24.82,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.03,0:21:28.78,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,No matter how it ended for them,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.78,0:21:34.15,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,the white dragon must have treasured \Nits friendship with the hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.56,0:21:37.62,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,For some reason, I'm sure of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.97,0:21:40.22,Main,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.08,0:21:51.03,Main,OLIVIA,0,0,0,,First the incident in Galoa, and now here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.28,0:21:54.03,Main,OLIVIA,0,0,0,,That's twice you've helped me out now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.31,0:21:55.85,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Sheer happenstance.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.14,0:22:01.37,Main,OLIVIA,0,0,0,,Have you decided to join \Nthe magic academy yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.71,0:22:05.43,Main,OLIVIA,0,0,0,,I'm sure it would be a very \Nfruitful experience for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.43,0:22:10.54,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Let me think about it some \Nmore. It does intrigue me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.54,0:22:13.30,Main - Top,OLIVIA,0,0,0,,I hope to hear a positive response.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.78,0:22:14.32,Main,DIADORA,0,0,0,,Dolan.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.05,0:22:16.39,Main,DIADORA,0,0,0,,For you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.81,0:22:18.61,Main - Top,DIADORA,0,0,0,,They're black rose seeds.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.61,0:22:21.28,Main - Top,DIADORA,0,0,0,,You can use them in magic potions.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.28,0:22:23.85,Main - Top,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Wow, now that's a pleasant surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.85,0:22:25.34,Main - Top,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Thank you, Diadora.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.23,0:22:29.44,Main,DIADORA,0,0,0,,Aside from that, I want to show my \Ngratitude to you in particular.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.20,0:22:34.43,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,Wha?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.66,0:22:42.09,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,D-Diadora? What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.84,0:22:45.56,Main - Top,DIADORA,0,0,0,,Oh, just my way of saying thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.26,0:22:50.79,Main - Top,DIADORA,0,0,0,,It's the least I could do \Nafter Dolan saved my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.10,0:22:57.20,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,E-Even I haven't gotten that far yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.84,0:23:24.87,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,We're back!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.00,0:23:28.20,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,You two did great.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.60,0:23:32.57,Main,CHRISTINA,0,0,0,,And to think we only set out to \Ninvestigate the change in the forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.57,0:23:35.72,Main,DOLAN,0,0,0,,Let's go report to the chief \Nafter leaving our things.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.02,0:23:39.39,Main,CELINA,0,0,0,,There's so much we have to tell everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.95,0:24:04.96,Next_Episode,SIGN,0,0,0,,Next Episode
